{
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "assetName": "BanhXeo_after_table_click",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"Hm?\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Fendory?\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Oh. The famous critic finally showed up.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"You’re working here?\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Temporary collaboration. Helps bring customers in.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I see.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"You’ve gotten pretty famous lately.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Well. Talent naturally attracts attention.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"…Sure.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Your Bánh Xèo is ready, sir.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "assetName": "BanhXeo_after_visual_scan",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"The crepe looks dramatic, at least.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The edge has a clean golden crust, but the filling looks heavily seasoned.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The dipping sauce has a light gloss, like there’s a small sugar lift in it.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Still, the darker specks around the filling make the seasoning look stronger than the balance.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"You already found something to complain about?\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I’m just reading the plate.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"It looks good, but it also looks easy to overdo.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "assetName": "BanhXeo_after_sound_scan",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"The shell breaks with a sharp little crack.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"That part is promising. The edge has a clean snap.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"But the sauce sounds too loose when I move through it.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"It runs away from the bite instead of staying with the crepe.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The sauce is meant to be light.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Light is fine. Thin is different.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "assetName": "BanhXeo_before_report",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"Alright, the dish is pretty clear.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The shell has a nice crackle, so the first bite has energy.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The sauce gives a small sugar lift, but it spreads too quickly.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The filling and sauce push the seasoning harder than they need to.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"So instead of feeling bright, the whole thing starts leaning heavy.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"There are good parts here, but the balance feels careless.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"That’s enough for the report.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "assetName": "BanhXeo_after_correct_submit",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"What did you think of the Bánh Xèo?\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The shell had a decent crackle.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"But the seasoning pushed too hard, and the sauce was too loose.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"…I understand.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"No. You don’t.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"What?\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"You used to smile when eating food.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Now you just sound like you’re trying to look superior.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"That’s called professionalism.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"No. That’s arrogance. When was the last time you actually enjoyed food?\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "assetName": "BanhXeo_after_wrong_submit",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "\"That report doesn’t match what I served.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"You’re saying I missed something?\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The shell, filling, and sauce each speak differently.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"If you only judge the look, you miss how it breaks and how the sauce moves.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Maybe slow down for once.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Fine. I’ll check it again.\"",
          "emotion": "Neutral",
          "continueCheck": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}